{"card":{"card_id":"ma-c-47f419da1dd3f7ca39ee","statement":"[<<cite:Fut1>>] Let $W$ be a simple $C({\\mathfrak h})$-module, and let $H_i=h_i {\\rm Id}$, $c_i=\\gamma_i {\\rm Id}$ on $W$, for some constants $h_i, \\gamma_i$, $i = 1,2$. Then the following identities hold on $W$.\n\n\\begin{eqnarray*}\naA & = & A^2+AB+BA+ABA-\\frac{1}{2}A^2 B-\\frac{1}{2}B A^2 +rB+\\tau I, \\\\\naB & =& B^2+AB+BA+BAB-\\frac{1}{2}B^2 A-\\frac{1}{2}A B^2 +r_1B+\\tau_1 I,\\\\\n\\frac{1}{4}(AB-BA)^2&=&\nABA+BAB+\\frac{1}{2}r B^2+\\frac{1}{2}r_1 A^2-\\\\\n& &(\\frac{a}{2}-1)(AB+BA)+(\\tau + r)B+(\\tau_1+r_1)A+\\eta I,\n\\end{eqnarray*}\n\nwhere\n\n\\begin{eqnarray*}\n&&r:=\\frac{1}{2}(h_{1}^{2}-2h_{1}), \\; r_{1}:=\\frac{1}{2}(h_{2}^{2}-2h_{2}),\\; a:=6\\gamma_{1}+h_1+h_2-\\frac{1}{3}h_{1}^{2}-\\frac{1}{3}h_{2}^{2}+\\frac{1}{6}h_{1}h_{2},\\\\\n&&3p:=\\frac{1}{9}(h_{1}-h_{2})^{3}-\\gamma_{2}+6\\gamma_{1}(h_{2}-h_{1}+3)-h_{1}^{2}-h_{2}^{2}-h_{1}h_{2}+2h_{1}-2h_{2}, \\\\\n&&\\tau:=\\frac{1}{2}h_{1}p+h_{1}h_{2}, \\;  \\tau_{1}=-\\frac{1}{2}ph_{2}^{2}+\\frac{1}{3}h_{2}\\left(18\\gamma_{1}-h_{1}^{2}-h_{2}^{2}-h_{1}h_{2}+3h_{1}\\right),\\\\\n&&\\eta:=\\frac{1}{4}p^{2}+\\frac{1}{6}p(h_{1}h_{2}+h_{1}^{2}+h_{2}^{2}-18\\gamma_{1})+\\frac{1}{4}h_{1}h_{2}(h_{1}h_{2}+4-2a).\n\\end{eqnarray*}","source_id":"arXiv:1812.07137","cluster":"representation_theory","statement_sha256":"5321374eed7bc6296767587afad2c4d22402090d1b1826d21dc4028c6ea57788","kind":"lemma","label":"Lemma 51","ref_key":"Lemma: Relations AB and constants ,p,eta","name":"","order":51,"deps":[],"cite_keys":["Fut1"],"provenance":{"source_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/1812.07137","harvest_mode":"arxiv_eprint","payload_sha256":"8f616d0dadfadd07368325eb5dcddec235c4bd760dc9d71a1a029bbeb9a88683","line":936,"origin":"latex_env","retrieved_at":"2026-09-29T14:18:01+08:00"},"wash":{"version":"cardwash.v2","stages":["segment","purify","classify","dedupe","emit"],"numbering":"document_order_with_label_heuristic","detail":{"stripped_proof":false,"chars":1137,"math_hints":138}}},"paper":{"source_id":"arXiv:1812.07137","title":"Classification of simple Gelfand-Tsetlin modules of $\\displaystyle \\mathfrak{sl}(3)$","abstract":"We provide a classification and an explicit realization of all irreducible Gelfand-Tsetlin modules of the complex Lie algebra sl(3). The realization of these modules uses regular and derivative Gelfand-Tsetlin tableaux. In particular, we list all simple Gelfand-Tsetlin sl(3)-modules with infinite-dimensional weight spaces. Also, we express all simple Gelfand-Tsetlin sl(3)-modules as subquotionets of localized Gelfand-Tsetlin E_{21}-injective modules.","authors":["Vyacheslav Futorny","Dimitar Grantcharov","Luis Enrique Ramirez"],"year":"2018","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/1812.07137","cluster":"representation_theory","macros":{"sm":"{\\mathsf m}","Ga":"{\\Gamma}","cD":"\\mathcal D","Stone":"\\fbox{\\makebox[11mm]{\\strut#1}}\\kern2pt"},"macros_override":["Stone","cD"]},"deps":[],"dependents":[]}